                <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[46px] font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-[0.95] text-slate-900 mt-4 max-w-[700px]">Chime Credit Builder Review 2026: No Fees, No Credit Check, Real Credit Building?</h1>
                <p class="text-[16px] text-slate-500 mt-4 max-w-[680px]">The Chime Credit Builder Visa® Secured Credit Card promises to build credit with no annual fee, no interest, and no credit check required. But you need a Chime Checking Account and qualifying direct deposit. Is it worth it in the United States?</p>

                <!-- Author Box -->
                <div class="mt-8 rounded-[16px] border bg-white shadow-sm p-5 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-start">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
